.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
.Dd September 5, 2026
.Dt SYSCTLCMPCTL 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sysctlcmpctl
.Nd command-line client for the system.Sysctl capability
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm get Ar name
.Nm
.Cm set Ar name Ar value
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads and writes kernel
.Xr sysctl 3
variables through the
.Dq system.Sysctl
capability provided by
.Xr localsysctl 8 ,
subject to the caller's per-label policy.
.Cm get
prints the value of
.Ar name ;
.Cm set
assigns the string
.Ar value
to
.Ar name .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr sysctl 8 ,
.Xr libsysctlcmp 3 ,
.Xr localsysctl 8
